  "schema_version": 1,
  "description": "Shared VeriHire skills dictionary. Single source for skills.py. v1.3.3: domain skills for non-tech roles (finance, HR, sales, healthcare, teaching, hospitality, construction, design, legal); v1.3.7: IT operations skills (Windows Server, Active Directory, VMware, Cisco, ITIL, ...); v1.4.2: business skills (list-only generic words, see skills._LIST_ONLY).",
